Notes & gotchas (read me)
	•	Credentials & SSL: for t3s:// on Dev, ensure trust (set -Dweblogic.security.SSL.ignoreHostnameVerification=true or import certs).
	•	Passwords: JDBC user/password are not readable from Dev; set them once on local after the DS is created (or extend script to set from env vars).
	•	Targets mapping: Dev clusters/servers likely don’t exist locally; the script maps to DefaultServer. Adjust choose_targets() if you use another local server.
	•	Adapter plans: The script copies deployment plan variable values. If your local adapter deployment doesn’t define those variables, create/update the plan once via Console, then re-run apply.
	•	OSB scope: Export is “entire domain”. If you only want specific projects, modify the OSB export to pass a Set<Ref> (project refs) instead of None.
	•	Apps/Libraries: Manifest captures names/targets, but doesn’t redeploy EARs/JARs (you may not have the binaries). If you need them, add a packaging/artifacts step or pull from your artifact repo.

